></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bJogXY"><property name="text"><string>Jog to XY</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Lift Z to Start Z if it is lower, then move the camera to the search XY.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bSetStart"><property name="text"><string>Set Start Z</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Keep the current Z as Start Z (the top of the sweep; + Z is down, so the smaller Z).</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bSetStop"><property name="text"><string>Set Stop Z</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Keep the current Z as Stop Z (the bottom of the sweep and its collision limit).</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_bButtons1"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="11" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_bButtons2"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bPatternBox"><property name="text"><string>Pattern box</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Show the box the pattern is learnt from on the camera image; drag it over a distinctive part of the trolley next to fid0.</string></property><property name="checkable"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bLearn"><property name="text"><string>Learn pattern</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Learn the pattern inside the box from the camera image on screen (in focus, over fid0).</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_bFind"><property name="text"><string>Find</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Run the START st