-</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="3" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dRow3"><property name="text"><string>Circle</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="3" column="1" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dCircle"><property name="text"><string>-</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="4" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dRow4"><property name="text"><string>Residual limit</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="4" column="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="dspin_dResidual"><property name="decimals"><number>3</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>0.01</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>5</double></property><property name="singleStep"><double>0.01</double></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="minimumSize"><size><width>80</width><height>0</height></size></property><property name="suffix"><string> mm</string></property></widget></item><item row="5" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dRow5"><property name="text"><string>Max angle</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="5" column="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="dspin_dAngle"><property name="decimals"><number>2</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>0.05</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>45</double></property><property name="singleStep"><double>0.1</double></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="minimumSize"><size><width>80</width><height>0</height></size></property><property name="suffix"><string> deg</string></property></widget></item><item row="6" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dRowSearch"><property name="text"><string>Corner search</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="6" column="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="dspin_dSearch"><property name="toolTip"><string>How far from where a corner should be Check still takes the nearest circle as that corner. The first corner has no trolley turn to go on: 1 deg moves a corner 350 mm from fid0 by about 6 mm. A neighbouring circle taken by mistake ends up mm off the drawing rectangle and fails the residual limit.</string></property><property name="decimals"><number>1</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>1</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>20</double></property><property name="singleStep"><double>0.5</double></property><property name="value"><double>5</double></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="minimumSize"><size><width>80</width><height>0</height></size></property><property name="suffix"><string> mm</string></property></widget></item><item row="7" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dRow6"><property name="text"><string>Taught fit</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="7" column="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dFit"><property name="text"><string>-</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="8" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_dButtons1"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dTeachTL"><property name="text"><string>Teach TL</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the TL corner circle, then locate fid0 again: the offset between the two is stored. Put the camera over the circle at the 2D Z first.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dTeachTR"><property name="text"><string>Teach TR</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the TR corner circle, then locate fid0 again: the offset between the two is stored. Put the camera over the circle at the 2D Z first.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dTeachBR"><property name="text"><string>Teach BR</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the BR corner circle, then locate fid0 again: the offset between the two is stored. Put the camera over the circle at the 2D Z first.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dTeachBL"><property name="text"><string>Teach BL</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the BL corner circle, then locate fid0 again: the offset between the two is stored. Put the camera over the circle at the 2D Z first.</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_dButtons1"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="9" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_dJog"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dJogTL"><property name="text"><string>Jog TL</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Move the camera to the TL corner as taught: fid0 as found now + its offset, at the 2D Z (Z up to the 2D Z first if it is lower). Only once TL is taught.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dJogTR"><property name="text"><string>Jog TR</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Move the camera to the TR corner as taught: fid0 as found now + its offset, at the 2D Z (Z up to the 2D Z first if it is lower). Only once TR is taught.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dJogBR"><property name="text"><string>Jog BR</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Move the camera to the BR corner as taught: fid0 as found now + its offset, at the 2D Z (Z up to the 2D Z first if it is lower). Only once BR is taught.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dJogBL"><property name="text"><string>Jog BL</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Move the camera to the BL corner as taught: fid0 as found now + its offset, at the 2D Z (Z up to the 2D Z first if it is lower). Only once BL is taught.</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_dJog"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="10" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_dButtons2"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_dCheck"><property name="text"><string>Check</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Run the START step: from fid0 to each corner at the 2D Z, fit the drawing rectangle, judge each corner's residual and the angle.</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_dButtons2"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="11" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dFound"><property name="text"><string>Check has not run with these corners and settings.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="12" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_dNote"><property name="text"><string>Teach and Check need fid0 found on this trolley (Find in B) and the camera at its 2D Z. Each corner is stored as an offset from fid0, and fid0 is located again right after the corner, so a slow drift between teaches does not go into the offsets.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item></layout></widget></item><item><widget class="QFrame" name="frame_e"><property name="frameShape"><enum>QFrame::StyledPanel</enum></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">QFrame{background-color:#272c36; border-radius:12px;}QLabel{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox::indicator:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:3px solid #9DB8E0;}QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox, QComboBox{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border:1px solid rgb(27,29,35); border-radius:5px; padding-left:6px; min-height:22px;}QListWidget{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:5px;}QToolButton{background-color:#4A5F8C; color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:6px; padding:4px 10px;}QToolButton:hover{background-color:#5F8FCB;}QToolButton:pressed{border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:disabled{color:#6e6e6e; background-color:#444444;}</string></property><layout class="QGridLayout" name="gl_e"><property name="horizontalSpacing"><number>10</number></property><property name="verticalSpacing"><number>6</number></property><item row="0" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eTitle"><property name="text"><string>E   Slot size</string></property><property name="font"><font><pointsize>11</pointsize><weight>75</weight><bold>true</bold></font></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="0" column="1" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eState"><property name="text"><string>Not done</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="1" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eRow1"><property name="text"><string>Width x length</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="1" column="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eSize"><property name="text"><string>-</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="2" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eRow2"><property name="text"><string>Circle</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="2" column="1" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eCircle"><property name="text"><string>-</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="3" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_eButtons"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_eSetTL"><property name="text"><string>Set TL</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the slot circle nearest the image centre and keep it as the slot's TL circle (trolley frame).</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_eSetBR"><property name="text"><string>Set BR</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Centre on the slot circle nearest the image centre and keep it as the same slot's BR circle (trolley frame).</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_eButtons"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="4" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eFound"><property name="text"><string></string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="5" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_eNote"><property name="text"><string>Set TL and Set BR need the trolley found in this session (Check in D or Locate) and the camera at fid0's 2D Z. Put the slot's TL circle near the image centre and press Set TL, then its BR circle and Set BR: the camera centres on each, locates fid0 again so creep stays out, and comes back. The size is BR - TL along the trolley axes; setting a circle again after that starts a new pair. The slot centre is the midpoint of its two circles.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item></layout></widget></item><item><widget class="QFrame" name="frame_f"><property name="frameShape"><enum>QFrame::StyledPanel</enum></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">QFrame{background-color:#272c36; border-radius:12px;}QLabel{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox::indicator:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:3px solid #9DB8E0;}QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox, QComboBox{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border:1px solid rgb(27,29,35); border-radius:5px; padding-left:6px; min-height:22px;}QListWidget{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:5px;}QToolButton{background-color:#4A5F8C; color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:6px; padding:4px 10px;}QToolButton:hover{background-color:#5F8FCB;}QToolButton:pressed{border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:disabled{color:#6e6e6e; background-color:#444444;}</string></property><layout class="QGridLayout" name="gl_f"><property name="horizontalSpacing"><number>10</number></property><property name="verticalSpacing"><number>6</number></property><item row="0" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_fTitle"><property name="text"><string>F   Slots</string></property><property name="font"><font><pointsize>11</pointsize><weight>75</weight><bold>true</bold></font></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="0" column="1" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_fState"><property name="text"><string>Not done</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="1" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QListWidget" name="listWidget_fSlots"><property name="minimumSize"><size><width>0</width><height>90</height></size></property><property name="maximumSize"><size><width>16777215</width><height>160</height></size></property></widget></item><item row="2" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_fAdd"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QComboBox" name="comboBox_fCorner"><property name="toolTip"><string>Which corner of the slot the camera is on</string></property><item><property name="text"><string>TL circle</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>TR</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>BR circle</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>BL</string></property></item></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_fAdd"><property name="text"><string>Add</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Add the slot whose picked corner the camera is on; its size comes from E.</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_fAdd"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="3" column="0" colspan="3"><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="hl_fEdit"><property name="spacing"><number>6</number></property><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_fInterp"><property name="text"><string>Interpolate</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Put the given number of slots evenly between the 2 selected slots of one row; all of them take the row's average Y.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QSpinBox" name="spin_fBetween"><property name="toolTip"><string>How many slots go between the 2 selected slots</string></property><property name="minimum"><number>1</number></property><property name="maximum"><number>20</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="minimumSize"><size><width>60</width><height>0</height></size></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QLabel" name="label_fBetween"><property name="text"><string>between</string></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_fDelete"><property name="text"><string>Delete</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Delete the selected slots and their units.</string></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_fRename"><property name="text"><string>Rename</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>Rename the selected slot.</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="hs_fEdit"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>40</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item><item row="4" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_fFound"><property name="text"><string></string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="5" column="0" colspan="3"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_fNote"><property name="text"><string>Add needs the trolley found in this session (Check in D or Locate). Put the camera on a corner of a slot and pick which corner it is: TL and BR are circles the camera centres on at the 2D Z (fid0 is located again, as in E); TR and BL are taken where the camera is. Select slots here (Ctrl+click for more than one) or in the layout (click, Ctrl+click adds or removes a slot); both follow each other. Interpolate puts slots evenly between the 2 selected slots of one row, all at their average Y. Slot positions are never typed.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">color:#A8B0BF;</string></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item></layout></widget></item><item><widget class="QFrame" name="frame_g"><property name="frameShape"><enum>QFrame::StyledPanel</enum></property><property name="styleSheet"><string notr="true">QFrame{background-color:#272c36; border-radius:12px;}QLabel{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox{color:#F0F0F0;}QCheckBox::indicator:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:3px solid #9DB8E0;}QSpinBox, QDoubleSpinBox, QComboBox{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border:1px solid rgb(27,29,35); border-radius:5px; padding-left:6px; min-height:22px;}QListWidget{background-color:rgb(27,29,35); color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:5px;}QToolButton{background-color:#4A5F8C; color:#F0F0F0; border-radius:6px; padding:4px 10px;}QToolButton:hover{background-color:#5F8FCB;}QToolButton:pressed{border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:checked{background-color:#5F8FCB; border:1px solid #FFE723;}QToolButton:disabled{color:#6e6e6e; background-color:#444444;}</string></property><layout class="QGridLayout" name="gl_g"><property name="horizontalSpacing"><number>10</number></property><property name="verticalSpacing"><number>6</number></property><item row="0" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_gTitle"><property name="text"><string>G   Units</string></property><property name="font"><font><pointsize>11</pointsize><weight>75</weight><bold>true</bold></font></property><property name="textInteractionFlags"><set>Qt::LinksAccessibleByMouse|Qt::TextSelectableByMouse</set></property></widget></item><item row="0" column="1" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="label_gState"><pr